{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "databricks-api-collection-2024",
    "name": "Databricks API - Collection Complète",
    "description": "Collection complète pour l'API Databricks REST 2.0/2.1.\n\n## Configuration initiale\n1. Dupliquer l'environnement `Databricks ENV`\n2. Renseigner `DATABRICKS_HOST` (ex: https://adb-xxxx.azuredatabricks.net)\n3. Choisir une méthode d'authentification :\n   - **PAT** : renseigner `DATABRICKS_PAT`\n   - **OAuth M2M** : renseigner `CLIENT_ID` + `CLIENT_SECRET`\n4. Lancer `Auth > Get OAuth Token` si OAuth M2M\n\n## Méthodes d'auth supportées\n- Personal Access Token (PAT)\n- OAuth 2.0 Machine-to-Machine (M2M)\n- Azure AD Token (Azure Databricks)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "DATABRICKS_HOST", "value": "https://YOUR-WORKSPACE.azuredatabricks.net", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "DATABRICKS_PAT", "value": "dapi...", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "CLIENT_ID", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "CLIENT_SECRET", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "AZURE_TENANT_ID", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "ACCESS_TOKEN", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "CLUSTER_ID", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "JOB_ID", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "RUN_ID", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "NOTEBOOK_PATH", "value": "/Users/user@company.com/MyNotebook", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth - Authentification",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET OAuth Token (M2M - Databricks Account)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('ACCESS_TOKEN', jsonData.access_token);",
                  "    console.log('✅ Token OAuth M2M stocké avec succès');",
                  "    console.log('Expires in:', jsonData.expires_in, 'secondes');",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.error('❌ Erreur récupération token:', JSON.stringify(jsonData));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "client_credentials" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{CLIENT_ID}}" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "{{CLIENT_SECRET}}" },
                { "key": "scope", "value": "all-apis" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{DATABRICKS_HOST}}/oidc/v1/token",
              "host": ["{{DATABRICKS_HOST}}"],
              "path": ["oidc", "v1", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Récupère un token OAuth 2.0 M2M (Machine-to-Machine) via les credentials d'un Service Principal Databricks.\n\n**Prérequis :**\n- Créer un Service Principal dans Settings > Identity & Access > Service Principals\n- Générer un Client ID et Client Secret\n- Assigner les permissions nécessaires au SP\n\nLe token est automatiquement sauvegardé dans la variable `ACCESS_TOKEN`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Azure AD Token (Azure Databricks)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('ACCESS_TOKEN', jsonData.access_token);",
                  "    console.log('✅ Azure AD Token stocké avec succès');",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.error('❌ Erreur:', JSON.stringify(jsonData));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "client_credentials" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{CLIENT_ID}}" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "{{CLIENT_SECRET}}" },
                { "key": "resource", "value": "2ff814a6-3304-4ab8-85cb-cd0e6f879c1d" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://login.microsoftonline.com/{{AZURE_TENANT_ID}}/oauth2/token",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["login", "microsoftonline", "com"],
              "path": ["{{AZURE_TENANT_ID}}", "oauth2", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Récupère un token Azure Active Directory pour Azure Databricks.\n\n**Prérequis :**\n- App Registration Azure AD avec les permissions Databricks\n- `AZURE_TENANT_ID` = ID du tenant Azure\n- `CLIENT_ID` = Application (client) ID\n- `CLIENT_SECRET` = Client secret de l'app\n\nLa ressource `2ff814a6...` est l'ID fixe de l'API Azure Databricks."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Test Auth - Valider le token courant",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{ACCESS_TOKEN}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{DATABRICKS_HOST}}/api/2.0/token/list",
              "host": ["{{DATABRICKS_HOST}}"],
              "path": ["api", "2.0", "token", "list"]
            },
            "description": "Valide que le token courant fonctionne en listant les tokens PAT de l'utilisateur."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "CREATE Personal Access Token (PAT)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{DATABRICKS_PAT}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"comment\": \"Token généré via API - Postman\",\n  \"lifetime_seconds\": 7776000\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{DATABRICKS_HOST}}/api/2.0/token/create",
              "host": ["{{DATABRICKS_HOST}}"],
              "path": ["api", "2.0", "token", "create"]
            },
            "description": "Crée un nouveau Personal Access Token (PAT).\n\n- `lifetime_seconds`: Durée de vie (7776000 = 90 jours, 0 = pas d'expiration)\n- `comment`: Description du token\n\n⚠️ Sauvegarder le `token_value` retourné - il ne sera plus accessible ensuite."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
